<div class="back-design memoir-back" aria-hidden="true">
  <img src="/images/books/the-100-hackathoner-back.webp" alt="" width="1024" height="1536" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
  <svg viewBox="0 0 300 450" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <text x="38" y="43" class="eyebrow">THE STORY BEHIND THE BUILDS</text>
    <text x="38" y="78" class="headline"><tspan x="38">What stays with you</tspan><tspan x="38" dy="27">after the demo?</tspan></text>
    <path d="M38 122H79"/>
    <text x="38" y="147" class="blurb">
      <tspan x="38">In 2016, one hackathon became the start</tspan>
      <tspan x="38" dy="15">of a much longer journey.</tspan>
      <tspan x="38" dy="24">Through teams, deadlines and wrong turns,</tspan>
      <tspan x="38" dy="15">a Singapore engineer keeps showing up —</tspan>
      <tspan x="38" dy="15">and begins to see beyond the code.</tspan>
      <tspan x="38" dy="24">The pursuit of one hundred hackathons.</tspan>
      <tspan x="38" dy="15">The lessons that last beyond a weekend.</tspan>
      <tspan x="38" dy="15">The founder he is still becoming.</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="38" y="290" class="author">SAYYID KHAN</text>
  </svg>
</div>
<div class="back-design principles-back" aria-hidden="true">
  <img src="/images/books/forward-deployed-back.webp" alt="" width="1024" height="1536" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
  <svg viewBox="0 0 300 450" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <text x="38" y="43" class="eyebrow">FROM BUILDER TO OPERATOR</text>
    <text x="38" y="78" class="headline"><tspan x="38">Build with intent.</tspan><tspan x="38" dy="27">Make it matter.</tspan></text>
    <path d="M38 122H79"/>
    <text x="38" y="146" class="principle">Ship to learn.</text>
    <text x="38" y="160" class="blurb">Let real use challenge your assumptions.</text>
    <text x="38" y="183" class="principle">Repetition creates range.</text>
    <text x="38" y="197" class="blurb">Build judgement across different rooms.</text>
    <text x="38" y="220" class="principle">Own the outcome.</text>
    <text x="38" y="234" class="blurb">Follow the work beyond the demo.</text>
    <text x="38" y="257" class="principle">Compound the record.</text>
    <text x="38" y="271" class="blurb">Leave something the next build can use.</text>
    <text x="38" y="302" class="author">SAYYID KHAN</text>
  </svg>
</div>
